/**
@page docmap Module Documentation

Hand-written documentation for each module: usage guides, algorithm
descriptions and theory notes.  The class, file and namespace indices in
the navigation bar cover the generated API reference separately.

@section docmap_infrastructure Infrastructure

- @subpage mod_core &mdash; Logging, timing, types, constants and string tools
- @subpage mod_containers &mdash; Cell, Map, Bitset and the other BELFEM container classes
- @subpage mod_linalg &mdash; Backend-agnostic linear algebra API and LAPACK wrappers
- @subpage mod_sparse &mdash; Sparse storage and the solver interfaces (UMFPACK, MUMPS, STRUMPACK, PARDISO, PETSc)
- @subpage mod_io &mdash; HDF5, ASCII, CSV, configuration files and XML
- @subpage mod_comm &mdash; MPI communication abstraction layer
- @subpage mod_mesh &mdash; Mesh data structures, I/O (Gmsh, HDF5, Exodus, VTK) and parallel partitioning
- @subpage mod_visualizer &mdash; Optional VTK rendering of meshes and curves (USE_VTK, off by default)

@section docmap_mathematics Mathematics

- @subpage mod_math_graph &mdash; Graph algorithms and partitioning (BFS, DFS, RCM, METIS, SCOTCH)
- @subpage mod_math_tensor &mdash; Fourth-order tensor helper
- @subpage mod_math_quaternion &mdash; Quaternion value type for 3D rotations
- @subpage mod_numerics_spline &mdash; Spline interpolation
- @subpage mod_numerics_opt &mdash; NLOPT-backed bound-constrained minimisation
- @subpage mod_homology &mdash; Cohomology algorithms, cut generation and theory

@section docmap_finite_elements Finite Elements

- @subpage mod_fem &mdash; How the finite-element modules fit together
- @subpage mod_fem_kernel &mdash; DOF management, hanging nodes, assembly, time stepping and the nonlinear controller
- @subpage mod_fem_interpolation &mdash; Shape functions, integration points and Nedelec elements
- @subpage mod_fem_iwg &mdash; Integral weak forms (Poisson, heat conduction, elasticity, time stepping)
- @subpage mod_fem_maxwell &mdash; Electromagnetics: h-phi formulation, thin shells, HTS, cohomology cuts
- @subpage mod_fem_thermal &mdash; Transient heat conduction and the magneto-thermal coupling belfem selects for a thermal deck
- @subpage mod_fem_postproc &mdash; Mesh-level postprocessing: volumes, surfaces, normals, gradients, mesh checks

@section docmap_physics_and_circuits Physics and Circuits

- @subpage mod_physics_materials &mdash; Material property framework (pure metals, HTS, alloys, user-defined)
- @subpage mod_physics_database &mdash; Precomputed lookup tables on tensor grids
- @subpage mod_physics_gasmodels &mdash; Equation-of-state and transport models
- @subpage mod_physics_gastables &mdash; Tabulated thermophysical property data
- @subpage mod_circuit &mdash; Lumped-element circuit simulator coupled to the FEM problem
- @subpage mod_executables &mdash; belfem and the material, gas and db2exo tools, with their command-line interface

*/

